**Fix:** Gate the route behind authentication middleware and avoid returning sensitive fields unnecessarily.

```js
// ✅ FIXED — requires a valid bearer token before returning data
app.get('/users', authenticate, (req, res) => {
  // Return only the fields the caller actually needs
  const safeUsers = USERS.map(({ id, name }) => ({ id, name }));
  res.json(safeUsers);
});
